---
import Section from './Section.astro';
import { site } from '../config';

const milestones = [
  {
    title: 'Ktema Systems incorporated',
    body: 'Ktema Systems Sdn Bhd, in Malaysia, holding the specification and the engine.',
  },
  {
    title: 'On-media format complete at version 0.1',
    body: 'The layout, the keys, the encoding, and the derivation of identifiers, fixed.',
  },
  {
    title: 'First design partner signed',
    body: 'With integration started, and the warranty and safety documentation framework defined with that partner.',
  },
];

const funds = [
  {
    pct: '50%',
    alpha: '1',
    title: 'Engineering and compute',
    body: 'Founder compensation, the agent runtime that carries the engineering work, and the three items the first design partner needs: constrained arena scopes, flash footprint reduction, and a second conforming implementation.',
  },
  {
    pct: '15%',
    alpha: '0.7',
    title: 'Company setup and compliance',
    body: 'The incorporation of Ktema Systems in Malaysia, legal and accounting, and the warranty and safety documentation framework.',
  },
  {
    pct: '15%',
    alpha: '0.48',
    title: 'Design partner and field hire',
    body: 'The first design partner contract, the field-facing first hire, and the design partner pipeline.',
  },
  {
    pct: '20%',
    alpha: '0.28',
    title: 'Reserve',
    body: 'Contingency across the 24-month runway.',
  },
];
---

<Section
  id="round"
  label="Round"
  title="Raising $1.2M at pre-seed"
  lede="Nine months of self-funded work already produced the engine, the proofs, the publications, and the hardware decoder. The engine risk is retired."
  band
>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      This round funds the commercial layer and closes the last three engineering items the first
      design partner needs. The commercial milestones come first; the engineering items run
      through the rest of the 24 months, because the first design partner’s integration depends
      on them. Those milestones trigger the seed round, and the design wins before it are
      founder-led.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h3>What this round reaches</h3>
    <div class="cards cards--3">
      {
        milestones.map((milestone) => (
          <div class="card">
            <h3>{milestone.title}</h3>
            <p>{milestone.body}</p>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h3>Use of funds (draft)</h3>
    <div class="alloc">
      {
        funds.map((fund) => (
          <span
            class="alloc__part"
            style={`width:${fund.pct};background:rgba(44,111,143,${fund.alpha})`}
          />
        ))
      }
    </div>
    <ul class="funds">
      {
        funds.map((fund) => (
          <li class="fund">
            <span class="fund__pct">{fund.pct}</span>
            <div>
              <h3>{fund.title}</h3>
              <p>{fund.body}</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>
  </div>

  <dl class="spec">
    <dt>Structure</dt>
    <dd>
      Ktema Systems Sdn Bhd, to be incorporated in Malaysia, will hold the Ktema specification
      and the engine, sell the certified build and the support behind it, and license the decoder
      to silicon vendors later. Ktema itself is proprietary. The layers beneath it, neXus, chton,
      and syntagma, are Apache 2.0, documented at <a href={site.docs}>docs.ssccs.org</a>, and
      will be held by the SSCCS Foundation, an open-source research foundation to be formed
      later.
    </dd>
    <dt>Runway</dt>
    <dd>24 months. A Singapore holding company remains an option for a later round.</dd>
    <dt>Instrument</dt>
    <dd>
      The instrument and the terms are expected to be set with the lead investor; they are not
      fixed yet.
    </dd>
  </dl>

  <p class="closing">
    The endgame is a device that can account for its own history, with no server in the path.
  </p>

  <div class="actions">
    <a class="btn btn--accent" href={`mailto:${site.contact}`}>Write to the founder</a>
    <a class="btn" href={site.github}>Code and papers</a>
  </div>
</Section>

<style>
  .alloc {
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  .funds {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    border-top: 0;
  }

  .fund {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 68px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    padding: 18px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
  }

  .fund__pct {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 14px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .fund p {
    margin-top: 5px;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .closing {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 1rem + 1.2vw, 1.9rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    color: #ffffff;
    max-width: 34ch;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .fund {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 6px;
    }
  }
</style>
